; AnaMark TUN v2 - a factory tuning that ships inside Fiblo Galactic.
; Generated by tools/MakeTunings.ps1 - edit that, not this.
;
; Harmonic series, partials 8 to 16, with harmonic 8 as the 1/1.
; Degrees: 9/8 10/8 11/8 12/8 13/8 14/8 15/8, repeating at 16/8 = 2/1.
; Two of them (11/8 and 13/8) exist nowhere in 12-TET.
;
; Degree 0 is MIDI key 60 at 261.6255653006 Hz (12-TET middle C),
; which is where the plugin anchors a scale's 1/1.

[Info]
Name=harmonic series 8-16
Author=Fiblo Galactic
Description=Harmonics 8 to 16 over harmonic 8: 9/8 5/4 11/8 3/2 13/8 7/4 15/8 2/1

